      "The canonical monoidal structure on the right double-dual functor has not yet been constructed in this repository.",
      "No canonical PivotalStructure or SphericalStructure has yet been derived from RibbonStructure.",
      "No trace-cyclicity theorem has yet been derived from the canonical pivotal structure.",
      "The finite semisimple fusion-category layer remains open.",
      "The two Bärenz-Barrett trace-pairing compatibility inputs remain open.",
      "No concrete category has been instantiated.",
      "This note does not establish a concrete four-manifold invariant."
